OL,3,ATrump arrives at high-speed IndyCar
OL,4,Arace through Washington's streets
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has arrived
OL,7,Fat the IndyCar race through the streets
OL,8,Fof Washington DC, which marks the
OL,9,Fculmination of a series of summer
OL,10,Fevents to celebrate the country's 250th
OL,11,Fbirthday.
OL,13,FThe president and First Lady Melania
OL,14,FTrump took a ceremonial lap of the
OL,15,F1.7-mile track in his presidential
OL,16,Flimousine, The Beast.
OL,18,FAs they reached the finish line,
OL,19,FTrump's new Air Force One completed a
OL,20,Fflyover above the capital.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
