OL,3,ATrump arrives at high-speed IndyCar
OL,4,Arace through Washington's streets
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Freedom 250 Grand Prix is the first
OL,7,Ftime professional road racing has been
OL,8,Fhosted in the capital.
